        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Glenn Hughes, Bon Scott\n- Bands: Deep Purple, Black Sabbath, Trapeze, AC/DC\n- Albums: From Now On...\n- Songs: Can I Sit Next to You, Girl\n\nFacts:\n- Bon Scott performed the lead vocals on the song \"Can I Sit Next to You, Girl\" by AC/DC.\n- Glenn Hughes was a former bassist and vocalist for Deep Purple, Black Sabbath, and Trapeze.\n- Glenn Hughes released the solo album \"From Now On...\" in 1994.\n- Glenn Hughes played more instruments than Bon Scott.",
